            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A’disiku fe yi pi tuke ma dri anzi Israelini ma eselia; ma o’du yi maniru, anzi dria opojo ma ti zipi, ada anzi Israelini dria ma anzi otile oko ’diyi ma paria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
